47. Design vs Actual vs Verified

Maintain three separate values:

1. Design Measurement.
2. Actual Executed Measurement.
3. Verified / Approved Measurement.

Calculate:

[
Variance=Actual-Design
]

[
Variance%=\frac{Actual-Design}{Design}\times100
]

Display variance without automatically declaring acceptance or rejection unless verified project-specific tolerances are configured.

